WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.733
The moment has come.

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:16.967
Centuries from now,

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:20.567
almost all humans
have lost the ability to see.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.200
Some say
sight was taken from them by God...

00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:31.933
to heal the Earth.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.200
For the few who remain,
vision is only a myth.

00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:44.333
But after so many years,
the power of sight has returned.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:47.800
What is it?

00:00:47.867 --> 00:00:48.933
Something's different.

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:51.167
The children.

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:54.267
They have the ability to see.

00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:00.700
My children...

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:05.467
they have the power
that we would call magical or evil.

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:07.433
We must protect them.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.800
For centuries,
we feared this day would come.

00:01:14.967 --> 00:01:18.133
The evil of light
once almost destroyed the world.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.333
And now it has returned.

00:01:21.833 --> 00:01:23.700
Find the children who can see...

00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:26.200
and bring them to me.

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:33.467
Now they will come for us.

00:01:33.533 --> 00:01:36.100
If we give the babies,
they might leave us alone.

00:01:36.967 --> 00:01:39.300
-No.
-I stand with Baba Voss!

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:50.033
These children are a gift.

00:01:51.933 --> 00:01:54.100
They will bring knowledge
that will begin a new world.

00:01:57.167 --> 00:02:01.567
We are family.
We are one and we fight as one.

00:02:15.467 --> 00:02:16.933
I have to keep you safe.

00:02:17.867 --> 00:02:19.100
The moment has come.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:27.200
It's astonishing how the smallest moment
can change an entire world.

